.DS_Store
DownloadedData/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
/models/
# Nothing under data/ is ever committed (regenerable simulation output --
# raw/feature CSVs, plots, per-run model artifacts, whatever format a given
# experiment happens to write). Root models/ used to be a separate,
# tracked exception to that -- deleted as stale; if the bare root
# pipeline is ever rerun standalone it regenerates models/ but that's
# now gitignored too, matching data/'s convention.
# Exception: data/README.md (layout/provenance doc, not generated output).
# Uses data/* (not data/) so git still descends into the directory --
# a bare "data/" pattern excludes the dir itself and negation can't
# un-ignore files inside an excluded directory.
data/*
!data/README.md
